      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent 1 — SEO strategist\n\n**Runs:** weekly.\n\n**Primary source:** a curated keyword backlog. The top queued keyword is picked and marked used immediately, so two runs can never claim the same one.\n\n**Fallback:** if the backlog is empty, Search Console keywords in striking distance (positions 5–20).\n\nClaude turns the keyword into a brief, a duplicate check runs against existing posts, and the brief is handed to Agent 2.",
